Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 19:50:31 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 35/62] Select image sources and update them when the device
 changes

Select an image from srcset, sizes and picture using the device, and load it again when its attributes, viewport, scale, colour scheme or media type change. Keep the old image until the new one arrives and ignore late arrivals for an outdated choice.

Co-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
